{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-04-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'STEPHANIE PLAINES JOINS NIELSEN BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NIELSEN HOLDINGS PLC (NYSE: NLSN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE ADDITION OF STEPHANIE PLAINES AS A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE WEDNESDAY, APRIL 21, 2021. SHE HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO THE BOARD'S AUDIT COMMITTEE AS WELL."}{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-04-23 06:30:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE\xa0BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NIELSEN HOLDINGS PLC (NYSE: NLSN) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.06 PER SHARE OF NIELSEN'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 17, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 3, 2021."}